ACOG postpartum RhIG within 72 hr; some benefit up to 28 days;
beyond 28 days no indication. At 6 months (180 days), RhIG is
not indicated.

Prophylactic steroids after recovery of HPA function are not
indicated. Correct: monitor for symptomatic disease recurrence;
no maintenance steroid needed.

